{"3615340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pepper the Giant Purple Dog", "steam_appid": 3615340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>How many lives is one good boy worth?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silvercity Sharks bring you their craziest horror game yet… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this twist on a harmless pet simulator, take care of Pepper, who happens to be a giant purple dog. You will be faced with such DIFFICULT tasks as: feeding, bathing, and walking Pepper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the dog’s hunger will continue to grow and grow and grow, until you are forced to decide how far you are willing to go for man’s best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with NPCs in the town of Normalville!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They welcome you with open arms, and shortcomings aside, are great neighbors! Are you willing to do what needs to be done?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras/d8f9821844eefc31752946ca4416215d.avif?t=1787072320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras_big/d8f9821844eefc31752946ca4416215d.webp?t=1787072320 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are secrets to be discovered…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple endings, and many routes to take, will you decide to take a pacifist approach? Or will you end up falling victim to the dog’s bidding? With coins to collect and the backend of the game to be peeled back, there is more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras/9d0dbf0bc2c1df6cc03f0703bbfeeaee.avif?t=1787072320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras_big/9d0dbf0bc2c1df6cc03f0703bbfeeaee.webp?t=1787072320 width=1560 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>How many lives is one good boy worth?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Silvercity Sharks bring you their craziest horror game yet… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this twist on a harmless pet simulator, take care of Pepper, who happens to be a giant purple dog. You will be faced with such DIFFICULT tasks as: feeding, bathing, and walking Pepper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the dog’s hunger will continue to grow and grow and grow, until you are forced to decide how far you are willing to go for man’s best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with NPCs in the town of Normalville!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They welcome you with open arms, and shortcomings aside, are great neighbors! Are you willing to do what needs to be done?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras/d8f9821844eefc31752946ca4416215d.avif?t=1787072320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras_big/d8f9821844eefc31752946ca4416215d.webp?t=1787072320 width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are secrets to be discovered…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple endings, and many routes to take, will you decide to take a pacifist approach? Or will you end up falling victim to the dog’s bidding? With coins to collect and the backend of the game to be peeled back, there is more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras/9d0dbf0bc2c1df6cc03f0703bbfeeaee.avif?t=1787072320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/extras_big/9d0dbf0bc2c1df6cc03f0703bbfeeaee.webp?t=1787072320 width=1560 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In this twist on a harmless pet simulator, take care of Pepper, who happens to be a giant purple dog. But when things go awry, you will have to decide: how many lives is one good boy worth?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Indonesian, Japanese, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“The tonal shift from cozy to deeply unsettling promises to be the game’s greatest trick, making you genuinely care before pulling the rug out with escalating moral dilemmas.”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/766ae8d3091ee2df3acb937520eada3adc51c2a7/header.jpg?t=1787072320", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/0511bb71a0c63a8317cb69820c977a790887a512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787072320", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615340/0511bb71a0c63a8317cb69820c977a790887a512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787072320", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Silvercity Sharks"], "publishers": ["Silvercity Shark